<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show rise in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show rise in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Thursday show that net currency reserves rose to about 107.3 billion marks in the week ending November 15 from about 106.6 billion in the week ending November 7.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    Nov 15	  Nov 7</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     123.0	   122.9</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   15.7	    16.3</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
